From 26ad6b4a237103ace7b54d214b1bf5977ac28445 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:29:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] test(git): RFC.md's VCS table row by row through the git
 import

vcs@mapping: a fixture repository (two authors, a branch, a merge, a
subject+body message, a deleted branch, an SSH-signed commit with a
throwaway key) imported with toolpath_git::derive. Commit -> Step,
Branch -> Path and Author -> meta.actors hold; the message body is
dropped from meta.intent, gpgsig never reaches meta.signatures, and
deleted branches leave no dead ends. Qualifier records on each row.
