 {"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"RFC.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:28:03.242849Z","id":"4188fae59914bcfc4bd303eb0604024b9c84af31c0b77762fa0edc94b6d85451","body":{"detail":"core_types@validate (crates/path-cli/tests/core_types.rs): a duplicated step id, a duplicated path id, a parent naming no step, and a head naming no step all validate. The JSON Schema cannot express these; the validator would need a structural pass after the schema.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":127},"end":{"line":127},"content_hash":"348caab9de8420e7f36d5a15f2b61a3eb6b1f56a1b3eaaf37d48e52104d2ce62"},"summary":"path p validate does not enforce ID uniqueness, parent references or path.head","tags":["rfc-types","goldens","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
